SUMMARY:Sunset hike at Taylor mountain regional park
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nStart your week of
 f right and join us for an enchanting evening at Taylor Mountain Regional 
 Park as we embark on a Sunset Hike! Witness the breathtaking transition fr
 om day to dusk while exploring the scenic trails and basking in the warm h
 ues of the setting sun. Enjoy an opportunity to connect with nature\, unwi
 nd\, and share the beauty of a sunset with like-minded individuals.\n\nWhe
 ther you're a seasoned hiker or just seeking a peaceful escape\, this even
 t promises a memorable experience. Don't forget to bring your comfortable 
 hiking gear\, a water bottle\, and a camera to capture the stunning sunset
  moments.\n\nThis will be a roughly 4 mile hike. There are many spots alon
 g the way up the hill to view the sunset but the goal will be to make it t
 o the top via the western route starting from the disk golf area. There is
  paid parking for $7 in the lot\, but there is free parking in the neighbo
 rhood at the base of the mountain. we will probably also get dinner somewh
 ere afterwards.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316651365/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260921T153901Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T153901Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
