SUMMARY:Oktober fest at brewsters beer garden
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nJoin us for Oktobe
 rfest at Brewster's Beer Garden! Celebrate the season with great beer\, go
 od food\, and great company. Whether you're a craft beer fan or just here 
 for the festive atmosphere and pretzels\, it's a fun\, casual evening out.
 \n\nEmbrace the Oktoberfest spirit\, enjoy the beer garden vibes\, and rai
 se a glass with us. Dress up in your best Oktoberfest attire if you're fee
 ling it\, and get ready to have a good time!\nProst!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316651550/
