SUMMARY:Corn maze\, pumpkin patch and dinner in Petaluma
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nJoin us for a fun-
 filled evening at the end of the work week full of twists and turns as we 
 explore the iconic corn maze and pumpkin parch in Petaluma! Navigate your 
 way through the towering corn stalks with friends\, laugh at wrong turns\,
  and see who can find the exit first!\n\nThis classic fall adventure is pe
 rfect for anyone looking to enjoy some lighthearted fun and get into the a
 utumn spirit. After the maze\, we will head down the road and find somethi
 ng good to eat.\n\nThe maze is $8 for entry and requires walking on uneven
  ground some come prepared.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316651421/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260921T154243Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T154243Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
