SUMMARY:Blind scream haunted house night
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nPrepare for a nigh
 t of spine-chilling thrills as we take on the Blind Scream Haunted House i
 n Santa Rosa! Join us for an unforgettable experience filled with scares\,
  screams\, and lots of fun—if you dare.\n\nWith eerie corridors\, terrif
 ying actors\, and heart-pounding surprises at every turn\, this haunted ho
 use promises a frightful adventure for everyone. Whether you’re a haunte
 d house pro or it’s your first time\, come share the thrills with friend
 s.\n\nThe haunted house costs 25 dollars to go through so come prepared fo
 r that. we will meet just outside of the venue around 8 and go through tog
 ether.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316651611/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260921T160107Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T160107Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
